# ⚠️ UPDATED FORK: MicroG Installer (no signature spoofing)

> **Note:** This repository is an actively maintained fork of the original project by [IsHacker003/microG_no_sigspoof](https://github.com/IsHacker003/microG_no_sigspoof). 
> 
> **What's new in this fork?**
> - Updated signature blocks (`sigs/signatures-google`) extracted from the latest official Google Play Services and Play Store APKs.
> - Verified compatibility and testing on AOSP 11+ GSI
> - The build process now automatically fetches and patches the latest microG releases.

**Original Credits & Attribution:**  
This project is built upon the excellent work of **IsHacker003**. The core structure, Makefile logic, and the `apksigcopier` implementation are entirely their creation. This fork simply keeps the project alive by providing up-to-date signature blocks.
